      "text": "Using the coastline as a referent, you've got Shady Sands about a week# inland, and Junktown a few days south of there. Hub's just another couple days# south of Junktown. Avoid Necropolis to the east of those, though. Not worth# the trouble.",
      "source_text": "Using the coastline as a referent, you've got Shady Sands about a week\n# inland, and Junktown a few days south of there. Hub's just another couple days\n# south of Junktown. Avoid Necropolis to the east of those, though. Not worth\n# the trouble.",
