    {
      "occurrence": 71,
      "number": 134,
      "number_raw": "134",
      "source_number": "134",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Shady Sands is a small, self-sufficient community led by Aradesh, a kind# man and strong leader. They are peaceful and hard-working. They are probably the# best chance for a new civilization here.",
      "source_text": "Shady Sands is a small, self-sufficient community led by Aradesh, a kind\n# man and strong leader. They are peaceful and hard-working. They are probably the\n# best chance for a new civilization here.",
      "source_line_start": 114,
      "source_line_end": 116,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 72,
      "number": 134,
      "number_raw": "134",
      "source_number": "134",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "沙荫镇是个自给自足的小镇。亚拉德什是一个和蔼、强壮的领袖。他们平静、努力工作。这里可能真的机会产生新的文明吧。",
      "source_text": "沙荫镇是个自给自足的小镇。亚拉德什是一个和蔼、强壮的领袖。他们平静、努力工作。这里可能真的机会产生新的文明吧。",
      "source_line_start": 117,
      "source_line_end": 117,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 73,
      "number": 135,
      "number_raw": "135",
      "source_number": "135",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Shady Sands is a small farming community. They were led by a good man# named Aradesh, but I've heard he's gone. It's a pity. Without him I don't know# if they'll survive.",
      "source_text": "Shady Sands is a small farming community. They were led by a good man\n# named Aradesh, but I've heard he's gone. It's a pity. Without him I don't know\n# if they'll survive.",
      "source_line_start": 119,
      "source_line_end": 121,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 74,
      "number": 135,
      "number_raw": "135",
      "source_number": "135",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "沙荫镇是个农业结构的社区。他们被一个叫亚拉德什的人领导着，不过我听说他已经不在了，太遗憾了。没有他，不知道这里能不能继续生存下去。",
      "source_text": "沙荫镇是个农业结构的社区。他们被一个叫亚拉德什的人领导着，不过我听说他已经不在了，太遗憾了。没有他，不知道这里能不能继续生存下去。",
      "source_line_start": 122,
      "source_line_end": 122,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 75,
      "number": 136,
      "number_raw": "136",
      "source_number": "136",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Junktown? A small trading city. Strange place until you get used to it.# They are run by mayor Killian Darkwater, a hard but fair man.",
      "source_text": "Junktown? A small trading city. Strange place until you get used to it.\n# They are run by mayor Killian Darkwater, a hard but fair man.",
      "source_line_start": 124,
      "source_line_end": 125,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 76,
      "number": 136,
      "number_raw": "136",
      "source_number": "136",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "迦克镇？一个小商业城市，你要刚去可能会不习惯，那是个奇怪的地方。他们的市长叫基利安，脾气不好但人不错。",
      "source_text": "迦克镇？一个小商业城市，你要刚去可能会不习惯，那是个奇怪的地方。他们的市长叫基利安，脾气不好但人不错。",
      "source_line_start": 126,
      "source_line_end": 126,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 77,
      "number": 137,
      "number_raw": "137",
      "source_number": "137",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Junktown? A small trading city. Strange place until you get used to it.# They are run by Gizmo, a gambling mogul and crime-lord.",
      "source_text": "Junktown? A small trading city. Strange place until you get used to it.\n# They are run by Gizmo, a gambling mogul and crime-lord.",
      "source_line_start": 128,
      "source_line_end": 129,
