    {
      "occurrence": 82,
      "number": 139,
      "number_raw": "139",
      "source_number": "139",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "哈勃城是主要的商业中心。你能找到所需要的一切东西，这里应该是个不错的选择。",
      "source_text": "哈勃城是主要的商业中心。你能找到所需要的一切东西，这里应该是个不错的选择。",
      "source_line_start": 137,
      "source_line_end": 137,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 83,
      "number": 140,
      "number_raw": "140",
      "source_number": "140",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Necropolis is the city of the dead. It's inhabited by ghouls, the# descendants of humans who sought shelter in a Vault there. Story goes that the# Vault failed somehow, so now the only inhabitants are carrion-eating monsters.",
      "source_text": "Necropolis is the city of the dead. It's inhabited by ghouls, the\n# descendants of humans who sought shelter in a Vault there. Story goes that the\n# Vault failed somehow, so now the only inhabitants are carrion-eating monsters.",
      "source_line_start": 139,
      "source_line_end": 141,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 84,
      "number": 140,
      "number_raw": "140",
      "source_number": "140",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "大墓地是个死亡之城。那里住着僵尸，它们以前是一个避难所的人类的后代。后来听说那避难所出了点事，导致现在那里唯一的居民都是吃腐肉的怪物。",
      "source_text": "大墓地是个死亡之城。那里住着僵尸，它们以前是一个避难所的人类的后代。后来听说那避难所出了点事，导致现在那里唯一的居民都是吃腐肉的怪物。",
      "source_line_start": 142,
      "source_line_end": 142,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 85,
      "number": 141,
      "number_raw": "141",
      "source_number": "141",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "It was overrun by an army of mutants last I heard. I'd stay away from# there, if I were you.",
      "source_text": "It was overrun by an army of mutants last I heard. I'd stay away from\n# there, if I were you.",
      "source_line_start": 144,
      "source_line_end": 145,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 86,
      "number": 141,
      "number_raw": "141",
      "source_number": "141",
